# Exception: immutable multi-GPU geometry manifest (under multi_gpu_nacl6).
# The .extxyz is intentionally NOT tracked: the full-precision LAMMPS .data is
# the single authoritative geometry for all tests (reduced-precision extxyz
# inflated water888 |dE| by ~1e-7 eV).
!multi_gpu_nacl6/structures/nacl6_rattle_fixed.manifest.json
